# MalloySim scenario: rotating equilateral three-body (Lagrange) configuration.
# Three equal masses on a triangle, with velocities for near-rigid rotation.

g 1.0
softening 0.001
dt 0.001
steps 10000
output_every 1000

body 1.0   1.0   0.0         0.0         0.75984
body 1.0  -0.5   0.8660254  -0.6580407399359999  -0.37992
body 1.0  -0.5  -0.8660254   0.6580407399359999  -0.37992

# Velocities are carried at full precision (0.8660254 * omega), not rounded, so
# this file reproduces the built-in three-body demo exactly.
#
# Expected final report (Debug and Release, MSVC):
#   step  10000   sep  1.73143038   E_total   -0.86601509   L_total    2.27951999
